Languages: `metadata.languages[].code`, fallback `metadata.languages[].name`? Check structure. likely `{code:'lat'}`. Preserve codes; existing records use names like "english". Mixed. Schema just array.

Place: `metadata.geographic?.placeString` or originInfoTypes placeTerms joined `; `. Keep `place` string.
Publisher: `metadata.originInfo?.publisher` or `originInfoTypes[].publisher` first.
Subjects: combine `metadata.subject?.topics` + geographics, dedupe, max maybe 20.
Physical extent.
`sourceModified`: accessInfo.accessInfoLastModified.
`dateDisplay`: issued untouched.
`originalCollection`: maybe `metadata.genres` joined? Could set `collection: 'Kart / Maps (Nasjonalbiblioteket)'`. But preserving institutional collection is important; NB may have `metadata.series` or `metadata.collection`. Inspect keys of metadata for one item.

